<section class="section research" id="research"><div class="copy"><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH FOR</div><h2>A more resilient future.</h2><p>We explore the material footprint of digital systems, from data centers and energy use to the communities and ecosystems they touch. Our work brings together technology, environmental systems, and real-world contexts to support more equitable and sustainable futures.</p><a class="pill" href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@gmail.com?subject=Hello%20Fieldline%20Systems">OUR APPROACH <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><img src="wildflowers.jpg" alt="Wildflowers growing in a green landscape" loading="lazy"><div class="overlay-card"><img src="river-sunset.jpg" alt="River through a green mountain valley at sunset" loading="lazy"><strong>Real systems.<br>Brighter futures.</strong></div></section></main>
